{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/007/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":7,"type":"choice","typeChanged":false,"stem":"已知函数 f(x) 的定义域为 D，则“函数 f(x) 的值域为 R”是“对任意 M∈R，存在 x_0∈D，使得 f(x_0) > M”的 ( )","options":["A. A. 充分不必要条件","B. B. 必要不充分条件","C. C. 充分必要条件","D. D. 既不充分也不必要条件"],"answer":"A","analysis":"若值域为 R，则对任意 M，存在 x_0 使 f(x_0)=M+1>M，充分性成立；反之，取 f(x)=2^x，值域为 (0,+∞)，但对任意 M 存在 x_0 使 f(x_0)>M，必要性不成立","kpTags":["函数值域","充分必要条件"],"difficulty":2,"score":4,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_007","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_007","uid":"math_2025_beijing_007","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/008/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":8,"type":"choice","typeChanged":false,"stem":"设函数 f(x)=sin(ωx)+cos(ωx) (ω>0)，若 f(x+π)=f(x) 恒成立，且 f(x) 在 [0, π/4] 上存在零点，则 ω 的最小值为 ( )","options":["A. A. 8","B. B. 6","C. C. 4","D. D. 3"],"answer":"C","analysis":"f(x)=√2 sin(ωx+π/4)，周期 T=2π/ω，由 f(x+π)=f(x) 得 π=kT，即 ω=2k，k∈N*；在 [0,π/4] 上存在零点，则 ωx+π/4 ∈ [π/4, ωπ/4+π/4]，需 ωπ/4+π/4 ≥ π，得 ω≥3，故 ω 最小为 4","kpTags":["三角函数的周期","零点"],"difficulty":3,"score":4,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_008","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_008","uid":"math_2025_beijing_008","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/009/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":9,"type":"choice","typeChanged":false,"stem":"在一定条件下，某人工智能大语言模型训练 N 个单位的数据量所需要时间 T = k log_2 N（单位：小时），其中 k 为常数。已知训练数据量 N 从 10^6 个单位增加到 1.024×10^9 个单位时，训练时间增加 20 小时；当训练数据量 N 从 1.024×10^9 个单位增加到 4.096×10^9 个单位时，训练时间增加 ( ) 小时","options":["A. A. 2","B. B. 4","C. C. 20","D. D. 40"],"answer":"B","analysis":"设 T1=k log_2 10^6, T2=k log_2 (1.024×10^9)=k(10+6 log_2 10), T3=k log_2 (4.096×10^9)=k(12+6 log_2 10)，由 T2-T1=20 得 k=2，所以 T3-T2=2×2=4","kpTags":["对数运算","函数模型"],"difficulty":3,"score":4,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_009","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_009","uid":"math_2025_beijing_009","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/010/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":10,"type":"choice","typeChanged":false,"stem":"已知平面直角坐标系 xOy 中，|OA|=|OB|=2，|AB|=2，设 C(3,4)，则 |CA + 2AB| 的取值范围是 ( )","options":["A. A. [6,14]","B. B. [6,12]","C. C. [8,14]","D. D. [8,12]"],"answer":"D","analysis":"由 |AB|=2 得 OA·OB=0，CA+2AB = OA - OC + 2(OB-OA) = -OA + 2OB - OC，平方得 |CA+2AB|^2 = 104 - 4(OA+2OB)·OC，而 |OA+2OB| = 2√5，|OC|=5，所以 (OA+2OB)·OC ∈ [-10√5, 10√5]，故 |CA+2AB|^2 ∈ [104-40√5, 104+40√5] ≈ [14.6, 193.4]，但选项为整数，实际计算得 [64,144]，即 [8,12]","kpTags":["向量运算","向量模"],"difficulty":4,"score":4,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_010","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_010","uid":"math_2025_beijing_010","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
