{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/012/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":12,"type":"fill","typeChanged":false,"stem":"已知 (1-2x)^4 = a_0 - 2a_1 x + 4a_2 x^2 - 8a_3 x^3 + 16a_4 x^4，则 a_0 = ________；a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + a_4 = ________","options":null,"answer":"1; 15","analysis":"令 x=0 得 a_0=1；令 x=1/2 得 0 = a_0 - a_1 + a_2 - a_3 + a_4，所以 a_1+a_2+a_3+a_4 = a_0 = 1？实际上，令 t=2x，则 (1-t)^4 = a_0 - a_1 t + a_2 t^2 - a_3 t^3 + a_4 t^4，令 t=1 得 0 = a_0 - a_1 + a_2 - a_3 + a_4，所以 a_1+a_2+a_3+a_4 = a_0 = 1？但答案给出 15，需重新计算：令 x=1 得 (1-2)^4 = 1 = a_0 - 2a_1 + 4a_2 - 8a_3 + 16a_4，又 a_0=1，所以 -2a_1+4a_2-8a_3+16a_4=0，即 -a_1+2a_2-4a_3+8a_4=0，与 a_1+a_2+a_3+a_4 关系？实际上，由二项式展开，a_0=1, a_1=8, a_2=24, a_3=32, a_4=16，所以 a_1+a_2+a_3+a_4=80？但答案 15 可能指 a_1+a_2+a_3+a_4=15？检查：令 x=1/2 得 0 = a_0 - a_1 + a_2 - a_3 + a_4，所以 a_1+a_2+a_3+a_4 = a_0 + 2(a_2+a_4)？不，由 0=1 - a_1 + a_2 - a_3 + a_4 得 a_1+a_2+a_3+a_4 = 1 + 2(a_2+a_4)？实际上，a_1+a_2+a_3+a_4 = (a_1 - a_2 + a_3 - a_4) + 2(a_2+a_4)？更简单：令 x=-1 得 (1+2)^4=81 = a_0 + 2a_1 + 4a_2 + 8a_3 + 16a_4，与 x=1 的式子相加得 82 = 2a_0 + 8a_2 + 32a_4，所以 a_2+4a_4=10，又 a_0=1，由 x=1/2 得 a_1 - a_2 + a_3 - a_4 = 1，由 x=-1/2 得 a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + a_4 = ？实际上，令 x=1/2 得 0 = a_0 - a_1 + a_2 - a_3 + a_4，所以 a_1 - a_2 + a_3 - a_4 = 1；令 x=-1/2 得 (1+1)^4=16 = a_0 + a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + a_4，所以 a_1+a_2+a_3+a_4 = 15。故答案为 1 和 15","kpTags":["二项式定理","赋值法"],"difficulty":2,"score":5,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_012","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_012","uid":"math_2025_beijing_012","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/013/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":13,"type":"fill","typeChanged":false,"stem":"已知 α, β ∈ [0,2π]，且 sin(α+β) = sin(α-β)，cos(α+β) ≠ cos(α-β)，写出满足条件的一组 α=________，β=_________","options":null,"answer":"π/2; π/6（答案不唯一）","analysis":"由 sin(α+β)=sin(α-β) 得 2cosα sinβ=0，所以 cosα=0 或 sinβ=0；由 cos(α+β)≠cos(α-β) 得 -2sinα sinβ≠0，即 sinα sinβ≠0，所以 cosα=0 且 sinβ≠0，故 α=π/2 或 3π/2，取 α=π/2，β 任意非 0,π 即可，如 β=π/6","kpTags":["三角恒等变换"],"difficulty":2,"score":5,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_013","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_013","uid":"math_2025_beijing_013","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/014/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":14,"type":"fill","typeChanged":false,"stem":"某科技兴趣小组通过 3D 打印机的一个零件可以抽象为如图所示的多面体，其中 ABCDEF 是一个平行四边形，平面 ARF ⊥ 平面 ABC，平面 TCD ⊥ 平面 ABC，AB ⊥ BC，AB ∥ RS ∥ EF ∥ CD，AF ∥ ST ∥ BC ∥ ED，若 AB=8, BC=4, AF=CD=5, AR=RF=TC=TD=2，则该多面体的体积为 ________","options":null,"answer":"60","analysis":"将几何体分割为直三棱柱 ARF-BHT 和四棱锥 B-HTES，计算体积之和再乘以对称性得 60","kpTags":["空间几何体的体积"],"difficulty":4,"score":5,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_014","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_014","uid":"math_2025_beijing_014","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/015/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":15,"type":"multi_choice","typeChanged":false,"stem":"关于定义域为 R 的函数 f(x)，以下说法正确的有________","options":["A. ①存在在 R 上单调递增的函数 f(x) 使得 f(x)+f(2x)= -x 恒成立","B. ②存在在 R 上单调递减的函数 f(x) 使得 f(x)+f(2x)= -x 恒成立","C. ③使得 f(x)+f(-x)=cos x 恒成立的函数 f(x) 存在且有无穷多个","D. ④使得 f(x)-f(-x)=cos x 恒成立的函数 f(x) 存在且有无穷多个"],"answer":"②③","analysis":"①假设存在，则 f(0)=0，当 x>0 时 f(4x)>f(2x)>f(x)>0，但 f(4x)+f(8x)=-4x，矛盾；②取 f(x)=-x/3 满足；③取 f(x)=1/2 cos x + mx，m∈R，有无穷多个；④令 x=0 得 0=1，矛盾","kpTags":["函数性质","存在性"],"difficulty":4,"score":5,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_015","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_015","uid":"math_2025_beijing_015","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/016/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":16,"type":"solve","typeChanged":false,"stem":"在 △ABC 中，cos A = -1/3, a = 4√2, sin C = √2/3.\n（1）求 c；\n（2）在以下三个条件中选择一个作为已知，使得 △ABC 存在，求 BC 的高.\n① a=6；② b sin C = 10√2/3；③ △ABC 面积为 10√2.","options":null,"answer":"（1）c=6；（2）选②：高为 10√2/3；选③：高为 20√2/9","analysis":"（1）由 sin A = 2√2/3，正弦定理得 c = a sin C / sin A = 6；（2）选①得 a=c=6，但 cos A<0 得 A 为钝角，C 也为钝角，矛盾；选②由正弦定理得 sin B = 5√2/9，高 AD = c sin B = 10√2/3；选③由面积得 b=5，余弦定理得 a=√(b^2+c^2-2bc cos A)=√(25+36-2*5*6*(-1/3))=√(61+20)=9，高 h=2S/a=20√2/9","kpTags":["正弦定理","余弦定理","三角形面积"],"difficulty":3,"score":14,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_016","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_016","uid":"math_2025_beijing_016","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/017/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":17,"type":"solve","typeChanged":false,"stem":"四棱锥 P-ABCD 中，△ACD 与 △ABC 为等腰直角三角形，∠ADC=90°，∠BAC=90°，E 为 BC 的中点.\n（1）F 为 PD 的中点，G 为 PE 的中点，证明：FG ∥ 面 PAB；\n（2）若 PA ⊥ 面 ABCD，PA=AC，求 AB 与面 PCD 所成角的正弦值.","options":null,"answer":"（1）证明见解析；（2）√3/3","analysis":"（1）取 PA 中点 N，PB 中点 M，连接 FN、MN，可证四边形 FGMN 为平行四边形，得 FG∥MN，从而 FG∥面 PAB；（2）建立空间直角坐标系，求出 AB 的方向向量和面 PCD 的法向量，计算夹角的正弦值","kpTags":["线面平行","线面角"],"difficulty":3,"score":14,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_017","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_017","uid":"math_2025_beijing_017","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/018/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":18,"type":"solve","typeChanged":false,"stem":"有一道选择题考查了一个知识点，甲、乙两校各随机抽取 100 人，甲校有 80 人答对，乙校有 75 人答对，用频率估计概率.\n（1）从甲校随机抽取 1 人，求这个人做对该题目的概率.\n（2）从甲、乙两校各随机抽取 1 人，设 X 为做对的人数，求恰有 1 人做对的概率以及 X 的数学期望.\n（3）若甲校同学掌握这个知识点则有 100% 的概率做对该题目，乙校同学掌握这个知识点则有 85% 的概率做对该题目，未掌握该知识点的同学都是从四个选项里面随机选择一个，设甲校学生掌握该知识点的概率为 p1，乙校学生掌握该知识点的概率为 p2，试比较 p1 与 p2 的大小（结论不要求证明）","options":null,"answer":"（1）4/5；（2）0.35，E(X)=1.55；（3）p1 < p2","analysis":"（1）频率估计概率为 80/100=4/5；（2）P(恰1人)=0.8×0.25+0.2×0.75=0.35，X 分布列：P(0)=0.05，P(1)=0.35，P(2)=0.6，E(X)=1.55；（3）由条件得 p1 + (1-p1)/4 = 0.8，解得 p1=11/15；p2 + (1-p2)/4 = 0.75，解得 p2=5/6，所以 p1 < p2","kpTags":["概率","数学期望","条件概率"],"difficulty":3,"score":14,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_018","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_018","uid":"math_2025_beijing_018","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/019/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":19,"type":"solve","typeChanged":false,"stem":"已知椭圆 E: x^2/a^2 + y^2/b^2 = 1 的离心率为 √2/2，椭圆上的点到两焦点距离之和为 4.\n（1）求椭圆方程；\n（2）设 O 为原点，M(x0, y0) (x0≠0) 为椭圆上一点，直线 x0x/2 + y0y/2 - 2 = 0 与直线 y=2, y=-2 交于 A, B. △OAM 与 △OBM 的面积为 S1, S2，比较 S1/S2 与 |OA|/|OB| 的大小.","options":null,"answer":"（1）x^2/4 + y^2/2 = 1；（2）S1/S2 = |OA|/|OB|","analysis":"（1）由 2a=4 得 a=2，e=c/a=√2/2 得 c=√2，b^2=a^2-c^2=2，椭圆方程为 x^2/4+y^2/2=1；（2）联立直线与椭圆得 M 为切点，计算 A、B 坐标，利用相似或向量夹角得 S1/S2 = |OA|/|OB|","kpTags":["椭圆方程","直线与椭圆","面积比"],"difficulty":4,"score":15,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_019","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_019","uid":"math_2025_beijing_019","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/020/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":20,"type":"solve","typeChanged":false,"stem":"函数 f(x) 的定义域为 (-1,+∞)，f(0)=0，f'(x) = ln(1+x)/(1+x)，l1 为 (a, f(a)) (a≠0) 处的切线.\n（1）求 f'(x) 的最大值；\n（2）当 -1<a<0 时，除点 A 外，曲线 y=f(x) 均在 l1 上方；\n（3）若 a>0 时，直线 l2 过 A 且与 l1 垂直，l1, l2 分别于 x 轴的交点为 x1 与 x2，求 (x1 - x2)/(2a - x1 - x2) 的取值范围.","options":null,"answer":"（1）1/e；（2）证明见解析；（3）[(e^2-1)/(e^2+1), 1)","analysis":"（1）求导得 g(x)=f'(x)，g'(x)=[1 - ln(1+x)]/(1+x)^2，令 g'(x)=0 得 x=e-1，最大值为 g(e-1)=1/e；（2）构造函数 h(x)=f(x)-[f'(a)(x-a)+f(a)]，证明 h(x)≥0 且等号仅在 x=a 成立；（3）求出 l1, l2 方程，得 x1, x2 表达式，代入化简得关于 f'(a) 的函数，利用 f'(a)∈(0,1/e] 得范围","kpTags":["导数","切线","函数最值"],"difficulty":5,"score":15,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_020","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_020","uid":"math_2025_beijing_020","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
{"source":"question-bank","sourceFile":"/home/flaskappuser/Desktop/NewDisk_2T/aitutor/database/question-bank/math/2025/021/content.md","subject":"math","year":2025,"province":"beijing","level":"gaokao","qn":21,"type":"solve","typeChanged":false,"stem":"设 A={1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8}，M={(x,y) | x∈A, y∈A}，从 M 中选出 n 个有序数对构成一列：(x1,y1), (x2,y2), ..., (xn,yn). 相邻两项 (xi,yi), (xi+1,yi+1) 满足：|xi+1 - xi| = 3, |yi+1 - yi| = 4 或 |xi+1 - xi| = 4, |yi+1 - yi| = 3，称为 k 列.\n（1）若 k 列的第一项为 (3,3)，求第二项.\n（2）若 τ 为 k 列，且满足 i 为奇数时，xi∈{1,2,7,8}；i 为偶数时，xi∈{3,4,5,6}；判断：(3,2) 与 (4,4) 能否同时在 τ 中，并说明；\n（3）证明：M 中所有元素都不构成 k 列.","options":null,"answer":"（1）(6,7) 或 (7,6)；（2）不能，理由见解析；（3）证明见解析","analysis":"（1）由定义，下一项坐标差为 (3,4) 或 (4,3)，从 (3,3) 出发得 (6,7) 或 (7,6)；（2）假设同时存在，考虑奇偶性矛盾；（3）反证法，假设所有元素构成 k 列，导出矛盾","kpTags":["新定义","组合数学"],"difficulty":5,"score":15,"hasImage":true,"srcId":"math_2025_beijing_021","srcUid":"math_2025_beijing_021","uid":"math_2025_beijing_021","imageCount":69,"rejectReason":["DUPLICATE_WITHIN_PAPER"]}
